        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for the Linux Kernel (Live Patch 23 for SLE 15 SP4)",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for the Linux Kernel 5.14.21-150400_24_108 fixes several issues.\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2024-35789: wifi: mac80211: check/clear fast rx for non-4addr sta VLAN changes (bsc#1227320).\n- CVE-2024-40956: dmaengine: idxd: Fix possible Use-After-Free in irq_process_work_list (bsc#1228585).\n- CVE-2024-36974: net/sched: taprio: always validate TCA_TAPRIO_ATTR_PRIOMAP (bsc#1227371).\n- CVE-2024-53104: media: uvcvideo: Skip parsing frames of type UVC_VS_UNDEFINED in uvc_parse_format (bsc#1236783).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
